    >

    <div class="hero-text">

      <h1>Dawit Girma Buayu</h1>

      <h2>Lecturer and Researcher | Water Resources Engineering</h2>

      <p>
        Department of Civil Engineering, Wolkite University, Ethiopia.
        Researcher and engineering professional specializing in
        hydrology, hydraulic engineering, water resources management,
        GIS and remote sensing applications.
